@startuml 05_seq_contradiction_detection
title "Sequence: Обнаружение фактологических противоречий"
autonumber

participant "Пользователь" as User
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Contradiction Detector" as Detector
participant "Vector KB" as KB
participant "Vector Store" as VS
participant "Metadata DB" as DB
participant "NLI Model" as NLI
participant "Report Builder" as Builder

User -> API: POST /check-contradictions
activate API

API -> Detector: find_contradictions(params)
activate Detector

Detector -> KB: get_statements_by_topic()
activate KB

KB -> VS: similarity_search(vector, top_k=100)
activate VS
VS --> KB: List[CandidateStatement]
deactivate VS

KB -> DB: FETCH metadata
activate DB
DB --> KB: List[EnrichedStatement]
deactivate DB

KB --> Detector: List[TopicRelatedFacts]
deactivate KB

Detector -> Detector: select_pairs_for_nli()

loop Для каждой пары фактов
  Detector -> NLI: classify_pair(premise, hypothesis)
  activate NLI
  NLI --> Detector: relation, confidence
  deactivate NLI
end

Detector -> Detector: filter_by_confidence(0.75)

Detector -> Builder: generate_report()
activate Builder
Builder --> Detector: ContradictionReport
deactivate Builder

Detector --> API: List[ContradictionPair]
deactivate Detector

API --> User: 200 OK
deactivate API

note right of Detector
  Критерии выбора пар:
  - Высокая косинусная близость
  - Противоположные ключевые слова
  - Одинаковые сущности
end note

note bottom
  SLA для детекции:
  - Поиск кандидатов: < 500 мс
  - NLI-классификация: < 100 мс/пара
  - Общий ответ: < 2 сек
end note

@enduml